<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s answer could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= draft.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The answer did not match the expected shape or broke one of this app&rsquo;s rules: it never writes a
    prayer, a blessing or scripture, never makes your ask longer, never adds a date you did not give, and always
    gives three answers to the question afterwards. Try again, or keep your own words.
  </p>
  <%= render "asks/draft_button", ask: ask, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
